# Disable Git line-ending conversion.
#
# THIS FILE IS LOAD-BEARING. Do not delete it.
#
# packwiz hashes every file in the index with sha256. On Windows, Git's autocrlf
# rewrites LF -> CRLF on checkout, which changes those hashes, which makes every
# client fail with "hash invalid" when packwiz-installer verifies the pack.
# The failure looks like a corrupt download, not a line-ending bug, and it will
# take the whole cast offline mid-session.
#
# If this file is ever added late, run:  git add --renormalize .
* -text
